   "scene_logic": "Dusk on a hill at a small torii gate, the sun low on the left. A steady wind blows to the left, carrying her hair and sash forward. The girl holds a paper sky lantern with a lit flame at her chest, lifts it over her head and lets go. Hot air and the wind carry it up and away toward the sun.",
